WEBVTT

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.950
It has been a long time, Princess.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.560
Thank you for the reception.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:42.890
The fourth ruins were,

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.720
indeed, at the coordinates you predicted.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:47.730
Yes.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.350
How is Il doing, by the way?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.950
Rescue

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.680
This feeling... of approaching climax!

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:48.180
I'm gonna nail you with 
everything I have pent up!

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.110
I'll go take out the enemies in back.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.620
I barely feel a thing! 
Are those toy guns or what?

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.250
Let me show you what a real 
heavy hit feels like!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.090
I will kill all.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:21.340
And here's my take on a turkey slap!

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.720
It might just crush your jaw!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.350
I hate vulgar men.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.910
<i>Only the first shot had any effect?</i>

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.250
This is exactly why...

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.870
you're my favorite little bitch!

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:02.590
P7, the target is moving to 
the south! Be alert!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.640
P5, get away from the storage units!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.930
P1 and P2, get out into the 
central road so you can see—

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:12.230
<i>She's too fast! I can't keep up!</i>

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.020
<i>Th-That's...</i>

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.980
Seigi! Over there!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:17.690
It's her!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.880
I won't let you kill anyone else!

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.750
The slicing hand cloaked in nothingness?

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.420
Don't think I'm at a disadvantage 
because I'm bare-handed!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.840
Come to think of it, 
you have a partner, don't you?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.890
You're okay leaving him alone?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.850
I am only acting alongside him 
for the sake of the mission.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.230
<i>Here!</i>

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.820
You must be one lonely girl!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.070
Lonely?

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.990
That self-righteous attitude, 
those pitying, condescending eyes...

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:15.040
Those are the things I hate most.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.630
I have stolen, injured, and killed 
for the sake of staying alive.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.380
I don't need partners now.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:29.220
The only person I revere and 
wish to protect is the princess.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.810
If you think you can withstand 
my loyalty, go ahead and try!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.140
<i>Touko-san, can you hear me?</i>

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:38.600
<i>Touko-san!</i>

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.820
Tom-san?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.900
Please give the receiver to Seigi-kun.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.110
<i>There's something I need to tell him.</i>

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.030
G-Got it.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.660
O-Ow...

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.740
Seigi! It's Tom-san!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:55.750
Tom-san?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.790
I'm going to tell you how to 
beat Schrödinger's Cat.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:05:59.880
<i>For real?!</i>

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:00.630
For real!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.170
<i>What the hell is that ability?!</i>

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.840
<i>The source of Schrödinger's Cat's power 
is the uncertainty principle.</i>

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.600
<i>If there's no observer, she can't return 
her indistinct self to normal... I think!</i>

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.220
You think?!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.520
I get it.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.030
I just have to close my eyes.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.200
S-Safe...

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:33.490
<i>He really didn't know for sure?!</i>

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:37.120
Do you think that will improve 
your chances of winning?

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.170
That won't work!

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.130
Seigi, run!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.670
You aren't the only observer around here.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:02.900
A cat?

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.610
Izzy...

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.110
Damn, the anesthetic...

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.990
Ow!

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.410
Hey, I'm fine.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:29.170
<i>It hurts... My body is burning... 
I'm gonna die...</i>

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.760
Seigi...

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:38.720
Seigi!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:45.360
You...

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.940
I swear...

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.690
I won't let you get away with this!

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.150
<i>I'm being pushed back?</i>

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.410
<i>Is the tattoo's boost 
power passing into her?</i>

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.370
The power of will...

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:00.410
<i>Her strong desire to protect 
Seigi-kun is letting her</i>

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.750
<i>draw power from the tattoo's owner!</i>

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:06.590
Don't get cocky!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:12.260
Why do you not simply erase 
everything with Void Maker?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.510
Who are you?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.600
Are you telling me to kill her?

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.390
You said you would negate that girl.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.390
That would be proper.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:26.310
Your power, after all, exists for 
the purpose of negating others,

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:30.070
the world, and all of creation.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.860
Quit running your mouth!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.530
Fine, have it your way! I'll negate you!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.580
I will protect Touko!

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.240
You die first.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.550
<i>You used Void Maker to create 
empty space underground?</i>

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.550
I don't want to hit a girl!

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.130
You'll die this time!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.890
Y-You're holding me like a princess—

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.440
This is the difference between 
someone who's fighting to protect

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.480
and someone who's fighting to kill.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.070
Kill me.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:12.990
Seigi, you're not gonna—

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:18.030
You? Why are you here?

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.080
What the hell?

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.960
So you do have a partner.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.750
There's no way I'd kill you.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.210
What I want to negate isn't you,

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.380
it's your words.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.130
You're a fool.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:39.510
You don't know anything about me.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.560
Maybe I don't...

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.190
Of course you don't.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.860
The likes of you can't understand 
what's in Il's heart.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:53.320
Princess!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.610
Where'd she come from?

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.820
Wait, "Princess"... The Kingdom's ruler?

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.870
Crap... Lost too much blood...

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.330
Now, now, you mustn't overdo it.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.790
If you do, you'll be eaten up.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:22.180
Of course, you're just a child, 
so that didn't count.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.970
I'll purify you, Princess!

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:25.680
Wait, what? Wh-What?!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.640
I-I-Indirect kiss!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.190
All right! I'll bleep you later, so behave!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.730
B-Bleep?!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.360
So, you are Akatsuka Justice, correct?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.320
Don't use my real name...

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.830
I can't believe you made Il cry. 
You have my compliments.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.330
However...

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.750
If you weren't able to use
the Void Maker with precision,

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:50.670
both Il and that girl would have been dead.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.210
No matter what happens, 
I won't let anyone die!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:58.380
You are naïve... But you 
have surprising potential.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.010
Perhaps I can count on you.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.600
What are you talking about?

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.180
Il, time to go.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.060
Meow, meow...

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:07.270
Wait!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.560
They disappeared...

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.900
The only thing a tattoo that manipulates

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.820
the laws of physics can't mess with

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:19.360
is another Sealed's body!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.280
Close combat is the most

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.200
surefire double-edged blade!

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.800
Give it up already...

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:42.260
Or do you think you can keep up that

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:46.220
cushion of compressed air 
that's protecting you?

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.570
What the hell was that?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:00.740
It was my compressed air. 
That was a high-explosive air shell.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.950
You seem to be capable of freely 
manipulating the weight of objects,

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.740
but I guess you can't defend 
against shock waves.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.670
I was giving you a handicap

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:18.000
so Lisa wouldn't get hurt, small fry!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.840
Checkmate!

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.890
Return checkmate.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.390
It can't be...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.560
You fell for the same trick again!

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.860
Could you be any more careless?!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.150
Now, lose all hope!

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:42.070
Let me hear that cute cry of yours!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.360
We'll start by widening that cute little—

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.170
Lisa!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.170
That's my lethal attack, 
Return-Return Checkmate!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:01.050
When did you...

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:04.590
Whoa, wai—

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.590
Get yourself off!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:12.770
Mission complete.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.890
What a nice breeze...

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:19.690
You've always had a problem 
with following through...

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.940
Ow, ow, ow.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.480
I'm glad you're okay.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.410
Couldn't you finish a mission

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.120
this simple without Cal?

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.660
Aryabhata... The princess...

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.250
Of the Kingdom? How did she get here?

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.420
Through the Link.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.500
Link?

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.960
It looks like we've lost 
this time. Let's withdraw.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.760
Don't joke around! Leave him here!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.670
Do you know how many people he's killed?!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:48.550
Well, if you insist,

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:51.100
then kill me and take him back...

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.810
But only if all of you are prepared 
to die where you stand.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.440
What is that?

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.190
That's... No! Could it be...

00:13:59.190 --> 00:13:59.860
Impossible!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.280
The Sealed of the triggerless tattoo?

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.660
Seigi, what is that?

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.620
<i>So the thing Izzy was hiding...</i>

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:18.170
I'll keep one piece of the key in America.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:21.920
Be sure you learn to use 
it so that you don't die.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.630
Boy, learn more about tattoos,

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.800
and gain an understanding of them.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.550
The Source wants you.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.220
Source?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.020
What are you talking about? 
Seriously, what?!

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.570
Colonel Sanders...

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.620
I'm not a colonel.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.160
I just became a brigadier general.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.250
Actually, no, Colonel is fine.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.540
I like that name better, anyway.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:03.090
Then, Colonel, please tell 
me what my punishment is.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.050
Bear the responsibility until the end.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:07.920
Huh?

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.300
You will look after that boy.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:15.850
And of course, you'll make him 
participate in our tattoo research.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.890
There's no point if he doesn't.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.690
Is...

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:22.600
that all?

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:23.860
That's all.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.820
It's so nice out.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.200
No wonder the big vegetable sale is today.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.030
Learn more about tattoos, 
and gain an understanding of them.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.410
<i>I still don't know anything about tattoos.</i>

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.920
<i>I can't keep going like this.</i>

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:54.930
You're...

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.020
Oh? Well, well, who have we here?

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.680
We've just encountered a rare monster, Il.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.810
The Kingdom's...

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.860
Perfect timing! You need to tell m—

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:08.280
Seigi, go buy the things on this list.

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.150
Huh? But I need to talk to her...

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.570
Go buy them.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.530
O-Okay.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.290
What do you want with me?

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:22.120
I want a showdown, Princess Aryawhatever!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:22.790
What?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.750
I'm saying this as Seigi's guardian.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:30.260
Bam

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.250
If I win,

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:30.260
don't ever mess with Seigi again!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.970
Very well. I accept.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.930
But if I win,

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.180
those voluptuous breasts are mine.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.640
Bwoing

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.060
Huh?!

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:38.970
I'll kill you!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.180
Stop.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.890
F-Fine. You can do what you want.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.610
In two or three years, mine will...

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:51.740
No need to put yourself down, Il.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:54.240
Big breasts are filled with dreams,

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.780
but small ones are filled with hope.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.040
Now...

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:02.960
Let's go!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.290
<i>Damn.</i>

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.840
<i>Since I activated my tattoo 
earlier, she's also...</i>

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.380
You're open!

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.220
What's with this crowd?

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.100
<i>No! If this keeps up, I'll lose!</i>

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:26.480
It's over! Finishing move:

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.060
Dragon Fall!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.650
Touko...

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.570
Touko?

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:41.290
Touko!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.950
What, you were just playing table tennis?!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.580
Also, what the hell is going on?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:49.130
They're so soft, yet resilient.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.090
They have such a hyperbolic feel.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.050
So, boy, what is it you want to know?

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:57.680
Everything. About tattoos, 
the Kingdom... Everything.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.550
Tell me everything!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.310
Then first, I'll ask you...

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.520
For what purpose are you fighting?

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.190
What... purpose?

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:10.520
To stop the war you guys are starting...

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:14.360
Yeah. I want to stop people 
from killing each other.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.990
Isn't that the right thing to do?

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.660
For whom?

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.530
Huh?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.080
All I can tell you now is...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.000
If my wish is realized,

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.750
the world without fighting that 
you wish for will come to be.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:34.800
A world without... fighting?

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.720
If you join my side, 
I'll tell you everything.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.600
I'll welcome you anytime.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:47.680
So that brat is the third, huh?

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:51.770
He just needs me to guide him.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.770
It's been a long time, BB.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.490
Does your presence in Japan mean

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:59.030
the plan is moving to its next stage?

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.370
How dare you speak so brazenly to—

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:01.950
It's fine.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.910
Don't worry. Everything is just beginning.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.380
So, you guys have told me 
what your goal is, but...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.630
What is the US Army after, then?

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:19.420
What are they gathering tattoos for?

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.350
The US Army's goal is probably to use

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:25.430
the tattoos to take over the world.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.140
Take over the world?

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:30.140
I'm only speaking theoretically as of now,

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.480
but tattoos could potentially be

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.270
safer than nuclear weapons.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.070
There will be one major 
power in this world...

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:41.240
Only one major power in our future.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.620
Then what is the Kingdom after?

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.410
I don't know that,

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:49.000
but beneath the surface, there have been

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.910
repeated clashes with 
them over the tattoos.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.340
Will you still join our side?

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.630
No. I can't become a 
partner to the US Army.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.090
But...

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.430
If you're asking me to be your partner 
in stopping the war, then...

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:08.890
Seigi...

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:10.640
Thank you.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:15.860
By the way, something's been 
bothering me a lot...

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:17.400
Why are you in my house, again?

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:21.070
You destroyed my house, remember?

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:23.990
We'll be living in your house 
from now on, so, you know...

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:24.870
Thanks.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:28.120
My mom comes home sometimes! 
What am I supposed to tell her?!

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.790
Your mother flies around the world 
for work and is rarely home.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.920
Your cute childhood friend lives next door,

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.880
and she made you dinner just last night.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.590
What eroge is this? 
What's with the clichéd setting?

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.090
This isn't a light novel!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:43.220
Die, normie! Necrotize! Drown!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:44.260
Thanks to you, his collection 
of otaku... figures?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.300
Damn it, I couldn't be more 
jealous, you bastard!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.300
They're all gone.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.510
My favorite stuffed animals, too.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.230
Er... u-uh...

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.230
I'm sorry.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.110
Ah, yes...

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.700
What a lovely morning after.

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:58.640
Hey there, brat.

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:02.230
Want some gum?

00:23:02.230 --> 00:23:02.940
No, thanks.

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:04.440
I see...

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.740
Why don't you come with me for a bit?

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:12.820
Are you from the Kingdom?!

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:13.910
Brahman.

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:15.740
I knew it!

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:44.810
BB... Blood... is in Japan?

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:46.650
Hey, brat,

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.940
what is the correct choice to 
make as a hero of justice?

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:53.490
Killing goes against my 
idea of justice, you see,

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.080
Reunion

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:54.700
so I'll tell you.
